{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50701","headline":"寓居临平山下三首 其一 · 张祜","name":"寓居临平山下三首 其一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三月平湖浪（《大典》及《临平记》作「草」。\n）欲齐，绿杨分映（《临平记》作「影」。\n）入长堤。\n田家起处乌龙（《临平记》作「犹」。\n）静，（《大典》及《临平记》作「吠」。\n）酒客醒时谢豹啼。\n溪（《大典》及《临平记》作「山」）槛正当莲叶渚，水泾新麦稻苗畦。\n（《大典》作「水堘新擘稻秧畦」，《临平记》作「水塍新筑稻秧畦」。\n）人间谩说多歧路，咫尺神仙洞却迷。\n（《临平记》作「路欲迷」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}